BioCAD contains no vendored third-party source. Every library below is resolved
at build time by vcpkg (`vcpkg.json`) or is a Windows platform component; every
data source below is either referenced by a URL in the source or cited inside
`assets/packs/*.json`. No third-party dataset is redistributed in this
repository.


